  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project on Prevention and elimination of Violence Against Women in Lao PDR, Phase II(UNFPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improving institutional capacities for the prevention of gender based violence, adolescent pregnancy and early marriage, 2. Improving institutional capacities on VAW response through improving protection shelters and strengthening social and health services providers, 3. Improving institutional and policy framework aimed at accelerating the elemination of gender-based violence against women and promoting women&apos;s participation, 4. Enhancing stakeholders&apos; capacities in VAW through GEVAW Center</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the governance mechanism and policy framework to mainstream the prevention and elimination of gender-based violence against women and promote women&apos;s rights and participation in Lao PDR&#xC5EC;&#xC131;&#xD3ED;&#xB825; &#xC608;&#xBC29; &#xBC0F; &#xB300;&#xC751;&#xCCB4;&#xACC4;&#xC758; &#xD6A8;&#xACFC;&#xC131;, &#xD6A8;&#xC728;&#xC131;, &#xCC45;&#xBB34;&#xC131; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD574;&#xC11C; &#xC5EC;&#xC131;&#xD3ED;&#xB825; &#xD53C;&#xD574;&#xC790;/&#xC0DD;&#xC874;&#xC790;&#xC758; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xC9C0;&#xC6D0; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4;&#xC758; &#xC774;&#xC6A9; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;</narrative>
  </description>
